{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#card-zh","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown 是面向 DSH Web 的服务开关插件，在 Settings 中加入「服务开关」页面，并在宿主注册关机与重启端点。用户可以先查看二次确认，再发送请求关闭 DSH 服务，或请求以专用退出码重启服务；页面显示操作结果并尝试关闭标签页。重启退出码可由配套 PowerShell 启动器捕获并重新启动 dsh web。适合需要从浏览器设置界面管理本机 DSH Web 进程的用户。需要安装在 DSH Web 插件环境中，不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-81","lib/client.js:108-177","launcher/dsh-web.ps1:151-158"]}
{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#card-en","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-shutdown adds shutdown and restart controls to DSH Web Settings. After confirmation, it posts to a host endpoint and shows the result. A companion PowerShell launcher can restart dsh web after the restart exit code. It needs a DSH Web plugin environment, with no API key or external account.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-81","lib/client.js:108-177","launcher/dsh-web.ps1:151-158"]}
