{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#feature-1","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown 的功能「关机服务」：Settings 的服务开关页提供关闭按钮，用户确认后向宿主端点发送 POST；端点先返回结果，再延迟退出 DSH 进程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:137-147","lib/index.js:43-68"]}
{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#feature-2","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown 的功能「重启服务」：用户确认后，设置页向重启端点提交 POST；宿主以专用退出码结束，配套启动器捕获该退出码并再次启动 dsh web。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:42-53","lib/index.js:72-81","launcher/dsh-web.ps1:151-158"]}
{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#feature-3","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown 的功能「操作反馈」：确认操作后页面展示关闭成功或重启中的状态；收到 HTTP 错误或无法解析的响应时显示错误信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:61-79","lib/client.js:81-94"]}
{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#feature-4","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown 的功能「卸载清理」：插件注册设置页时同时登记清理回调，卸载或热重载时移除页面注册和注入的样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:163-177"]}
{"unit_id":"knlght__DSH-shutdown#caveat-1","repo":"knlght/DSH-shutdown","commit":"ae80cbf854184f218f4425dbae973dc8bd8f2451","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown 使用前须知：确认关机或重启会终止 DSH 服务进程，页面也提示正在进行的对话会被中断，操作前应先确认当前会话状态（见 lib/index.js:63-66、lib/client.js:110-114）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-66","lib/client.js:110-114"]}
